WEBVTT

00:29:29.829 --> 00:29:34.621
for movies is it's given
people time to write,

00:29:34.621 --> 00:29:37.996
not just a pilot or a rough outline,

00:29:37.996 --> 00:29:43.288
but write entire seasons of a series
before it even goes, which, you know,

00:29:43.663 --> 00:29:48.871
you want to be flexible and you want to be
able to cast a role and realize, oh,

00:29:48.871 --> 00:29:51.704
my God, we've got to do this with this
character because we didn't realize it

00:29:51.704 --> 00:29:54.329
or this thing isn't working the
way I thought it would. But

00:29:56.204 --> 00:29:58.746
this time has allowed writers to,
you know,

00:29:58.746 --> 00:30:03.246
write without the pressure of we have
to be casting this thing right now.